cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "whole_genome_pairwise_alignment"
abstract: >-
  Nextflow pipeline for whole-genome pairwise alignment with LAST, followed by
  UCSC chaining and netting (axtChain, chainMergeSort, chainPreNet, chainNet,
  netSyntenic, netToAxt), using the CNEr "near" preset. Version 1.0.0 is the
  implementation used for the alignments, chains and nets of the carp
  developmental regulatory atlas.
type: software
authors:
